        "model": {
          "answer": "D",
          "by": "sonnet",
          "agrees": null,
          "solution_html": "<p>Dla ostrosłupa o podstawie n-kąta: wierzchołki = n+1, krawędzie = 2n, ściany = n+1.</p><p>Ściany+krawędzie = (n+1)+2n = 3n+1 = 40 → n=13. Wierzchołków: n+1=14.</p>"
